    <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 60px;"><div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div><div class="container"><p style="color:#93c5fd; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600;">BLOG</p><h1 style="font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;">Best Video Review Platforms in India 2026</h1><p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#cbd5e1; max-width:700px;">A practical comparison of the top platforms for Indian brands — features, pricing, and which one fits your needs.</p><div class="header-accent"></div></div></section>
    <section style="background:#fff; padding:60px 0;"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px; line-height:1.8; color:#475569; font-size:1.05rem;">
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Video-review platforms serve different workflows: public review profiles, ecommerce review collection, retail syndication, or controlled research exports. This comparison focuses on five widely used options and the buyer questions that distinguish them.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">1. AnalyzeG — Best for Indian D2C Brands</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>What it does:</strong> Face-presence verified 30-second in-hand video reviews with Power BI dashboards, sentiment analysis, and raw CSV/Excel export. Projects starting at ₹5L. One-time pricing, no subscription — final quote after scoping.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;"><strong>Why it fits:</strong> Designed for Indian D2C brands that need original in-hand video evidence, Power BI analysis, and a gated raw export. Five screening checks plus human moderation reduce submission risk. Available in-stock datasets may be delivered in minutes; advertising rights apply only where the relevant reviewer has opted in.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">2. Bazaarvoice — Best for Enterprise Retail Syndication</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>What it does:</strong> Enterprise UGC and review-syndication workflows for major retail networks, with text, photo, and video formats across supported integrations.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;"><strong>Best fit:</strong> Brands that need retailer syndication and enterprise onboarding. Commercial terms and integration coverage should be confirmed directly with the vendor.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">3. Yotpo — Ecommerce Review Suite</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>What it does:</strong> Ecommerce review, loyalty, SMS, email, and UGC workflows with plan-based modules and integrations.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;"><strong>Best fit:</strong> DTC teams prioritising storefront review collection and marketing automation. Confirm current channel support, media options, and export limits with the vendor.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">4. Trustpilot — Public Company Review Profile</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>What it does:</strong> Public review profiles, TrustScore, business profiles, and review invitations with text, image, and video support on current plans.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;"><strong>Best fit:</strong> Companies prioritising public reputation and marketplace-style discovery. It is not a controlled research dataset with a Power BI export by default.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">5. Reviews.io — Mid-Market Review Collection</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;"><strong>What it does:</strong> Text, photo, and video review collection with integrations, structured data options, and plan-based commercial terms.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;"><strong>Best fit:</strong> Brands seeking conventional review collection rather than a bespoke screened-video research dataset. Verify current plan limits and exports with the vendor.</p>
