      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Which Platform Should You Choose?</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Choose <strong>AnalyzeG</strong> when the requirement is a controlled set of screened in-hand videos, Power BI analysis, and a gated raw export for an Indian D2C research project.</p>
